      "body": "The first release of Ribbon.\n\n### New\n- **Polish on Enter**: spelling, typos, punctuation and wrong words (ill → I'll) fixed as you finish each paragraph\n- **Alternate lines** in the margin, with OK and Skip\n- **AI score** that keeps track of how much of the book is yours\n- **Word alternatives**: double-click or right-click any word\n- **Local AI**: one-click model downloads, or bring any `.gguf` file\n- Manuscript-format **PDF** and plain-text export\n- Bold, italic, underline, chapter headings and scene breaks\n",
